            "sid": "ECC 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Maũndũ onthe mokaa ũndũ ũmwe kwa onthe; ve ũndũ ũmwe kwa ũla mũlũngalu na kwa ũla mũthũku; kwa ũla mũseo na kwa ũla mũtheu na ũla mũvuku; kwa ũla ũthembaa na kwa ũla ũtathembaa; o tondũ ũla mũseo ũilyĩ, now’o mũndũ mwathe ũilyĩ; na ũla wĩvĩtaa, o ta ũla ũkĩaa wĩvĩto. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "ECC.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "ECC.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
